OL,4,C'Dishonest' police officers sacked for 
OL,5,Clying over fatal crash searches        
OL,6,GTwo officers who lied about carrying   
OL,7,Gout missing person searches linked to  
OL,8,Ga crash in which three people died     
OL,9,Ghave been sacked after being found     
OL,10,Gguilty at a police misconduct hearing. 
OL,12,FPC Richard Hardwick and PC Lauren      
OL,13,FLivingstone faced gross misconduct     
OL,14,Fallegations over their actions before  
OL,15,Fa car carrying five people was found   
OL,16,Fcrashed two days later in St Mellons,  
OL,17,FCardiff, in 2023.                      
